" Only used when ``pbr=True``. Default is 0.0."
msgstr ""

#: of pyvista_js.plotter.Plotter.add_mesh:14
msgid ""
"Roughness factor for PBR, between 0 (mirror-like) and 1 (fully rough). "
"Only used when ``pbr=True``. Default is 0.5."
msgstr ""

